  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ホント！？\r\nよかった～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ\r\nそっかー合格かー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "第１審査のときよりも、嬉しそうだな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "まーね！\r\n甘奈、最近は自分でも少し頑張ってるって自覚あるんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だからその頑張りがこうやって結果になるのは\r\n嬉しいかなって思う",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n最近の甘奈は見ていて安心できるよ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "レッスンだけでなく、\r\n甜花と一緒に自主練もしているみたいだし",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっ、プロデューサーさん、知ってたの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "当たり前だろ、プロデューサーなんだから\r\n甘奈たちのことはちゃんと見ているつもりだぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、それは……\r\nうれしいかも……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……あ、そうそう！\r\n甘奈、もう一つ嬉しいことがあって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっなんだ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "最近甘奈のことを応援してくれる人が\r\nどんどん増えてるって感じるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それを素直に嬉しく思えるようになったのも、\r\n頑張りが周りに伝わるって、気付けたからなのかも",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈はいつもレッスンに真面目に取り組んでいるからだろうな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分のことだけじゃなくて、\r\n甜花の魅力も引き出そうと努力している",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなしっかり者の甘奈だから結果が付いてきたんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、褒められちゃった☆\r\nホントに、甘奈たちのこと見ててくれてるんだね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、いつもありがと！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001030120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "よーし\r\n第３審査も通過できるよう、甘奈、頑張っちゃうよー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400103/7014001030120"
  },
